## Parameters

<ParamField query="after" type={"string"}>
Pagination cursor from listMetadata.after for the next page. Cannot be combined with before.
</ParamField>

<ParamField query="before" type={"string"}>
Pagination cursor from listMetadata.before for the previous page. Cannot be combined with after.
</ParamField>

<ParamField query="limit" type={"integer"}>
Maximum number of authorized applications to return, from 1 to 100. Omit to use the default page size.
</ParamField>

<ParamField query="order" type={"ListAuthorizedApplicationsOrder"}>
Result ordering: normal, descending (desc), or ascending (asc). Omit to use the default order.
</ParamField>


## Returns

**`200`** OAuth applications authorized by the authenticated user. ListAuthorizedApplicationsResponse

<ResponseField name="authorizedApplications" type={"array of AuthorizedApplication"} required>
One page of applications authorized by the authenticated user.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="listMetadata" type={"ListAuthorizedApplicationsResponseListMetadata"} required>
Pagination cursors to pass as after or before in the next list request.
</ResponseField>

